================================================================================

The decision corpus
   This project is built on the GAO-Bid-Protest-Dataset assembled by Kevin
   Misener (https://github.com/kmisener90/GAO-Bid-Protest-Dataset), a
   collection of roughly 5,700 GAO bid protest decisions released under a
   Creative Commons Attribution license. The URLs to the decision PDFs, the
   33-ground taxonomy, and the per-decision coding were derived from that
   corpus using AI. If you reuse the corpus, credit that source as well.

